---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About our crawler" description="What we fetch, how often, and how to ask us to stop.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">About our crawler</h1>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-slate-700">
      <p>
        We check publicly listed prices at a small set of fishing gear retailers using an automated
        crawler that identifies itself as <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">FishPriceBot</code>.
      </p>
      <p>
        We only fetch product pages and a small number of configured clearance/discovery pages — never
        site search, and never anything <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">robots.txt</code>
        disallows. We keep at most one request in flight per retailer at a time, with a delay of several
        seconds between requests, and daily limits per site.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you run a site we're checking and would like us to stop, contact us and we'll honor the
        request within 24 hours.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
